{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soap Slide</strong> is a physics-based party game set in a humorous, pastel-colored world. Slide your cute soap character through obstacles, compete in mini-games, and embrace the hilarious chaos\u2014alone or with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Support:</strong> Play together with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Part of the First Map:</strong> Experience the beginning area of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization Option:</strong> Access basic customization options for your character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031250/extras/94b20f8abcc1da7c22c12461505091b2.poster.avif?t=1760429707\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031250/extras/94b20f8abcc1da7c22c12461505091b2.webm?t=1760429707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slippery Physics Chaos:</strong> Slide, jump, and bump into others for laugh-out-loud moments.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031250/extras/f9d17313ab32f3feeb46b28b097b0b9b.poster.avif?t=1760429707\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031250/extras/f9d17313ab32f3feeb46b28b097b0b9b.webm?t=1760429707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><